    "when": "When ARIZONA is allowable and an asset matches an Arizona homestead, household-goods, firearm, or motor-vehicle category.",
    "procedure": "Use the substantive asset exemption: § 33-1101(A) for a qualifying occupied homestead, § 33-1123 for household furniture, goods, electronics, or appliances, § 33-1125(10) for firearms, and § 33-1125(8) for motor vehicles. A stated value above the statutory ceiling still permits the EC citation.",
